This CLI is a curated New Central client for the printing-press library.
cli-printing-press was not available in the environment that produced this tree, so the
v0.1 command surface (sync, brief, export, doctor, and the read commands around them)
was written by hand against public New Central paths. It is not output from the generator.

Endpoint paths follow public documentation and the MIT-licensed pycentral v2 SDK
docstrings (Hewlett Packard Enterprise). No customer credentials are included.

